  "passage_full": "Although you are not always aware of it, your body is constantly working. Although you are sleeping, your brain is still awake, sorting and storing information. If you do not get enough sleep, your brain will not work properly. Your heart never stops. It is constantly pumping blood around your body to bring oxygen and nutrients to your organs.\n\nIf your nose itches, a blast of air will come from your lungs to make you sneeze. Coughing is important, although it can be annoying. You will cough if there is something in your throat or lungs that should not be there.\n\nTo keep your body healthy and happy, you must eat well, get lots of exercise, and sleep for eight hours every night.",
